{"slug":"/students/subjects/physics/thermal/","source":"students/subjects/physics/thermal/index.html","area":"students","kind":"division","title":"Thermal Physics & Thermodynamics | Physics","description":"","subject":"physics","body":"<div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-8\">\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700\">← Back to Physics</a>\n    </nav>\n\n    <div class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-8\">\n      <header class=\"mb-12\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Thermal Physics &amp; Thermodynamics</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">Heat, temperature, transfer mechanisms, calorimetry, gas laws and basic thermodynamics.</p>\n      </header>\n\n      <div class=\"grid gap-8\">\n        <section>\n          <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Core Topics</h2>\n          <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/thermal/heat-temperature/\" class=\"block p-6 bg-white/50 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/60 transition duration-150\">\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">Heat &amp; Temperature</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Distinction, thermometers and temperature scales.</p>\n            </a>\n\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/thermal/calorimetry/\" class=\"block p-6 bg-white/50 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/60 transition duration-150\">\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">Calorimetry</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Measurement of heat, specific heat capacity and latent heat.</p>\n            </a>\n\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/thermal/heat-transfer/\" class=\"block p-6 bg-white/50 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/60 transition duration-150\">\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">Heat Transfer</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Conduction, convection and radiation.</p>\n            </a>\n\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/thermal/gas-laws/\" class=\"block p-6 bg-white/50 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/60 transition duration-150\">\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">Gas Laws</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Ideal gas law, PV relations and simple processes.</p>\n            </a>\n\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/thermal/thermodynamics/\" class=\"block p-6 bg-white/50 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/60 transition duration-150\">\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">Thermodynamics</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">First and second laws, engines and efficiency.</p>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section>\n          <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Why this module</h2>\n          <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n            <p class=\"text-gray-700\">Thermal concepts build on energy ideas and cover temperature measurement, heat transfer, and engines.</p>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n    .content-card {\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n    }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}